OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAAre digital memories helping us or
OL,4,Aholding us back?                       
OL,6,FKaren Sutton, who provides support for 
OL,7,Fbereaved people in her role as a widow 
OL,8,Fcoach based in Cheltenham, said: "There
OL,9,Fcan come a point when things that once 
OL,10,Fbought us comfort can actually be      
OL,11,Fholding us back."                      
OL,13,FWith our loved ones immortalised in the
OL,14,Fdigital world - their likeness         
OL,15,Fpreserved and always accessible - has  
OL,16,Fmodern technology permanently altered  
OL,17,Fthe process of saying goodbye?         
